  "body": "Using Matrix for communication is really fantastic!\r\nWe use it for our organisation and completly migrated from other messaging-services to Matrix.\r\nWe often assign tasks to a group of people, which then create a room for the conversation.\r\nIf you want to pass a information to all of them, by now you have to write individual messages to everyone - not very convenient.\r\nI would love to see an option which allows you to turn on direct messages to a room.\r\nAn answer to the message (by using the answer button) should then be directed to the original writer.\r\n\r\nThanks a lot!\r\n",
